---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Scale } from "lucide-react";
---

<Layout title="Terms">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-amber-400 rounded-2xl shadow-inner mb-4">
        <Scale className="w-8 h-8 text-stone-900" strokeWidth={2.5} />
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-stone-100">Terms</h1>
      <p class="text-stone-400 text-sm mt-1 font-medium">The basic rules for using the platform</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-stone-900 rounded-2xl border border-stone-800 p-6 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-400">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-extrabold text-stone-100 mb-1.5">Family use</h2>
        <p>
          3Aranda is meant for sharing memories within the family. Each account is personal and
          non-transferable; you're responsible for what you upload under your username.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-extrabold text-stone-100 mb-1.5">Content you upload</h2>
        <p>
          Content you upload (photos, videos, text) remains yours. By uploading it, you allow us to
          store it and show it within the platform to other family members. Don't upload content
          you don't own or that could harm others.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-extrabold text-stone-100 mb-1.5">A platform still in development</h2>
        <p>
          The platform is still being built and may change, have downtime, or bugs. We don't
          guarantee permanent availability, though we do our best to look after your memories.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-extrabold text-stone-100 mb-1.5">Accounts and access</h2>
        <p>
          Whoever manages the family account ("admin" role) may moderate inappropriate content or
          restrict access if these basic rules are broken.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
